WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:05.880
¿Qué estás buscando?

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:08.560
I need to see the footage

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:09.760
 from the night I was here.

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:13.840
She's my ex.

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:17.800
But...

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:20.400
That folder.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:24.720
Here
you are.

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:28.640
Okay.

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:30.240
Let's go.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:31.880
Yay!

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:33.240
Party!

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.520
Let's go, let's go, let's go.

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:41.400
Next one.

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:49.520
Aren't you

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:50.360
going inside?

00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:51.800
I'm just the host, honey.

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:52.880
Your dessert

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:54.000
is waiting for you inside.

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:55.600
Have fun.

00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:57.800
Pause it.

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:01.080
Robert, you need to leave now.

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:04.080
Wait, why?

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:05.440
I thought

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:07.000
we were in this together.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.000
I promised you dinner

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.520
in exchange for not prying

00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:10.920
into personal affairs.

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:13.360
And this is where you need

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:14.320
to stop.

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:21.720
Fine.

00:01:22.360 --> 00:01:23.720
But you owe me one.

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:31.280
Now,

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:33.240
show me the footage

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:35.520
from private booth number 5.
